          "fando-plan/scripts/codex_lm.py",
          "fando-verify/scripts/find_plan.py",
          "fando-verify/scripts/gather_implementation.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`codex_lm.py` imports `verify_codex_cli` from `call_codex.py`, which is primarily a CLI script with `main()` and process-exit concerns.",
          "`find_plan.py` and `gather_implementation.py` embed reusable discovery/diff logic and CLI formatting/exit handling in the same modules.",
