        "text": "I have actually created a new function prediction_to_parse_result() that directly converts DSPy predictions to ParseResult without going through markdown, updated run_parallel_reviews_dspy to use this direct path, and eliminated the inefficient text serialization/parsing roundtrip, and I am not gaming the score by resolving without fixing.",
        "attested_at": "2026-02-28T10:38:17+00:00",
